// A noise over the layer it grains, as Figma draws it (live-measured): the noise, scaled by how
// much the layer covers each pixel, source-over the layer. Where the layer draws nothing, the
// noise draws nothing; over a 30% fill it shows at 30%.
half4 main(half4 src, half4 dst) {
  return src * dst.a + dst * (1 - src.a * dst.a);
}
